{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cozy Gardener Simulator, you\u2019re more than just a gardener - you're the heart of a peaceful little town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your cozy, no-stress escape - a world where time moves gently and small acts of care make all the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Your Own Paradise</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small plot and develop it into a thriving garden. Plant vegetables, grow flowers, and restore neglected areas. Each action improves your garden and benefits the surrounding neighborhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Care for Your Town &amp; Its People</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist your neighbors with tasks, maintain public spaces, and improve the town\u2019s appearance. Building relationships and completing requests unlocks new opportunities and community progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock &amp; Discover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect new tools, unlock unique seeds, and discover delightful decorations to personalize your garden. As you expand your gardening skills, new opportunities open up - from secret garden spots to charming new areas to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf38 A Gentle World, One Task at a Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no deadlines here. No stress. Just calm, heartfelt gameplay that lets you take life one task - and one bloom - at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're planting sunflowers, mowing a neighbor\u2019s lawn, or sweeping leaves off a path, everything you do brings a little more joy to this cozy little world.<br><br>\ud83c\udf3c Cozy Gardener Simulator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peaceful life. A growing heart. Welcome home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831060?t=1754573476","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831060/fd57779105a676bc0c062bbad8a211919997b32a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754573476","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831060/b5a4db42d4f9a8054329f794968964190206124a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754573476","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831060/b5a4db42d4f9a8054329f794968964190206124a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754573476","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Cozy Gardener Simulator, you\u2019re more than just a gardener - you're the heart of a peaceful little town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your cozy, no-stress escape - a world where time moves gently and small acts of care make all the difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Your Own Paradise</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small plot and develop it into a thriving garden. Plant vegetables, grow flowers, and restore neglected areas. Each action improves your garden and benefits the surrounding neighborhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Care for Your Town &amp; Its People</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist your neighbors with tasks, maintain public spaces, and improve the town\u2019s appearance. Building relationships and completing requests unlocks new opportunities and community progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock &amp; Discover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect new tools, unlock unique seeds, and discover delightful decorations to personalize your garden. As you expand your gardening skil